OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murdering 51-year-old
OL,4,Ain Peterlee
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded not guilty to murder
OL,7,Ffollowing a fatal stabbing.
OL,9,FKenneth Fishwick, 53, denied the charge
OL,10,Fwhen he appeared at Teesside Crown
OL,11,FCourt.
OL,13,FHe is accused of murdering 51-year-old
OL,14,FDean Fishwick, who died in hospital
OL,15,Fafter being found with stab wounds at a
OL,16,Fproperty in Thames Road in Peterlee,
OL,17,FCounty Durham, on 23 September.
OL,19,FFishwick was remanded in custody ahead
OL,20,Fof a further court date in January. A
OL,21,Ftrial date was set for 12 April next
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
